# Bridgeworks Crown (CIPlay bridgeworks_crown): the landing roof, the bulletin, the screechers, the shutters, the
# three factions' roofs and demands, the letters and the three secrets (the code's pieces), the alarm bell (storm: the
# plan's piles rule), the keypad with a wrong code first, the council, five ways, FREE (the plan's freehold rule; the
# other levers then refuse), the verdict, the reward, Teo's message, the pile stair and the pile head; the treasure.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island Bridgeworks Crown
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Council in the Storm
expect hidden councilchest
expect hidden verdictfree
zone landing_roof
expect step 1
read Storm bulletin
expect step 2
kill Screecher
expect animals Screecher 0
expect step 3
use shutters
expect story shutters 1
expect step 4
zone authority_roof
expect step 5
read Authority demand
expect step 6
zone fleet_roof
expect step 7
read Fleet demand
expect step 8
zone union_roof
expect step 9
read Union demand
expect step 10
# STORY 10-24: the five recordings on the roofs
open Pip's recording
wait 2
open Nell's recording
wait 2
open Crane's broadcast
wait 2
open Teo's recording
wait 2
open Bram's recording
wait 2
expect story plea 5
expect step 11
read Complaint No. 400
expect step 12
open Faction letters
wait 3
expect step 13
read Authority secret
expect step 14
read Fleet secret
expect step 15
read Union secret
expect step 16
zone storm_ridge
expect step 17
read Councillor's notebook
expect step 18
open Bridgeworks crane's toolbox
wait 3
expect step 19
read Storm warden's notice
expect step 20
zone bc_trail
expect step 21
# (the ledge cache wants a keycard)
zone bc_summit
expect step 22
expect stand -79.26 25.11 h=50
open Storm beacon mast deck box
wait 3
expect story bc_top 1
expect step 23
use alarmbell
expect story alarm 1
# (reach|council_door is counted early, before its step comes)
zone council_door
expect step 25
code councilpad 1111 wrong
code councilpad 4719
expect hidden councilgate
expect story councilcode 1
expect step 26
zone council
expect step 27
read Five ways
expect step 28
use wayfree
expect shown verdictfree
expect shown councilchest
expect hidden verdictfleet
expect story choice 1
use wayfleet
expect hidden verdictfleet
expect story choice 1
expect step 29
read The verdict
expect step 30
open Council reward
wait 3
expect step 31
read Teo Varga's message
# (no step check here: in the plan the pile stair zone can already be passed on the way in)
zone pile_stair
read Pile engineer's map
expect step 34
zone pile_head
expect done
dig


# DEEP 10-24: the secret records room (button -> teleport; lever slides the secret wall panel open)
use bc_button
wait 4
read Sealed records
use bc_climbout
wait 4
zone bc_btnback

# STORY 10-24: the drowned council archive is optional now (the minutes of the last pile survey)
zone bc_deep
expect stand -77 -38 h=-17
open Council archive strongbox
wait 3
expect story bc_deep 1
